{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"This multi-story building named the Extraordinary Ordinary is in the heart of Hampstead.  It is a combination general store, tavern, inn, town meeting hall, and much more.  The main floor is a large room filled with table and chairs, sawdust on the floor, and a small, raised stage on one wall.  Semi-private meeting rooms are available to rent, and there are some rooms still available for rent upstairs.","created_at":"2021-06-06T20:28:23.050000Z","edited_at":"2021-06-19T19:53:26.458000Z","id":"851195841427669025","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"Its become common knowledge that the bartender and owner of the Ordinary, Heore, was a well known alchemist that became obsessed with the dead.  Rumor is, she will gladly accept dead body parts for her experiments and has discovered how to stitch people back together and bring them back to the land of the living.\n\n(This is a location you can sell crafting materials for coin)","created_at":"2021-06-09T14:19:41.198000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-06T18:09:27.665000Z","id":"852190219251744799","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
