{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"g229436_u79543_curie1.png","id":"863518829379452948","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/851195363888201749/863518829379452948-g229436_u79543_curie1.png","message_id":"863518829657456730","sha256":"fc17eccec3249aff8ba6ed1afeec77fb6154cbf5d45feebac066d90d51eb52fc","size":175807,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/851195363888201749/863518829379452948/g229436_u79543_curie1.png?ex=6ac0be54&is=6abf6cd4&hm=894a335525cd40d3ab3ce34b5063bdb45386ccd3ff681b23c3494c1bc46d4cb9&"}],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"an energetic older woman comes up to <@!246711433730064384> \"Ahyes, we haventmetyet.  I am Heore, mistress of this Ordinary.  Howcan I help you?\"","created_at":"2021-07-10T20:35:32.394000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863518829657456730","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"Tortillini takes a bow, with flair. \"My humblest greetings miss Heore, I am Tortillini. I believe myself either cursed most dreadfully or blessed with an innate luck, as I have miraculously survived thirty seven shipwrecks in disasters ranging from typhoons to monstrous attacks.\"","created_at":"2021-07-10T20:37:14.765000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863519259032289331","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"It is my understanding that part of your work is to unlock that which makes us living beings keep living, and I desire to hone whatever oddity I possess to ensure that I keep, mhm, living.\"","created_at":"2021-07-10T20:38:10.985000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-10T20:38:20.689000Z","id":"863519494835535922","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
